  "content": "你好世界<center>\n<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All_rights_reserved\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/assets%20license-All%20Rights%20Reserved-red.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"資產許可（未授權）\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/Treasure-Reforging/blob/1.19.4-develop/LICENSE.txt\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code%20license-LGPL%20v3.0-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"程式碼許可（LGPL v3.0）\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https%3A%2F%2Fshieldsio-patreon.vercel.app%2Fapi%3Fusername%3DTheAetherTeam%26type%3Dpatrons&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/118816101936267265.svg?label=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&logo=discord&color=7289DA&style=flat-square\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/DevAether\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/twitter-@DevAether-lightgrey?style=flat-square&logo=twitter&color=1DA1F2&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://mastodon.gamedev.place/@DevAether\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/mastodon/follow/110581810287361848?domain=https%3A%2F%2Fmastodon.gamedev.place%2F&style=flat-square&logo=mastodon&logoColor=white&label=mastodon&color=858AFA\" alt=\"Mastodon\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/aether-mod.net\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/bluesky-@aether--mod--net-lightgrey?style=flat-square&logo=data:image/svg+xml;base64,&color=0085ff&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Bluesky\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n<a href=\"https://www.threads.net/@devaether\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/threads-devaether-green?logo=data:image/png;base64,&style=flat-square&color=000000\" alt=\"Threads\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/AetherMod\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/facebook-AetherMod-blue?logo=facebook&style=flat-square&color=1877F2&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Facebook\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/devaether\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/devaether-instagram?color=D50060&label=instagram&logo=instagram&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Instagram\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@devaether\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/@devaether-tiktok?color=000000&label=tiktok&logo=tiktok&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"TikTok\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DevAether\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/youtube-@DevAether-blue?color=FF0000&label=youtube&logo=youtube&style=flat-square\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n<a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/theaetherteam\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitch/status/theaetherteam?logo=twitch&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Twitch\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/TheAether/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TheAether-reddit?color=FF4500&label=reddit&logo=reddit&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n<a href=\"https://aether.wiki.gg/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/wiki.gg-aether-green?logo=data:image/png;base64,&style=flat-square&color=FF1980\" alt=\"wiki.gg\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<h2><center>🔨 關於這個附加元件 🔨</center></h2>\n\n寶藏重鑄附加元件讓你將 **多餘的地牢戰利品** 回收成不同的裝備。這是透過使用新的 **鍛造模板** 搭配從某些裝備熔煉而獲得的 **獨特材料** 來完成的。\n\n海神裝備可以分解成 **海神網格**，女武神裝備可以分解成 **女武神錠**，而鳳凰裝備則可分解成 **火羽錠**。你甚至可以將太陽祭壇分解成 **火羽碎片**，這些碎片可以用黑曜石重新合成為火羽錠，或是用來重燃黑曜石盔甲。女武神錠和火羽錠甚至可以被製作成新的壓縮方塊。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/6371b821b24e43cf2fbc18f9405edef2bfe87e92/images/treasureReforging0.png\"></center>\n<br>\n\n<h2><center>☁️ 更多來自天境團隊的內容 ☁️</center></h2>\n\n如果你對這個附加元件有任何疑問，或者對天境團隊開發的其他項目感興趣，歡迎加入天境專案 Discord！我們友善的工作人員和熱情的社群將確保你感到賓至如歸！\n\n<center><a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image4.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></center>\n<br>\n\n你也可以透過在 Patreon 上贊助來支持天境團隊！每一筆贊助都直接投入開發，使我們能夠繼續做我們最熱愛的事情。\n\n<center><a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image3.png\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></center>\n<br>",
